# ─── macOS / Linux / Windows / Web ───────────────────────────────────────────
**/macos/Flutter/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.swift
**/macos/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/linux/flutter/ephemeral/
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/

# ─── Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets are passed with --dart-define, never committed and never bundled as
# an asset — see docs/handbook/10-observability.md. These entries are a
# backstop in case anyone reaches for a dotenv out of habit.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.p12
*.p8
secrets.json
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist

# ─── Generated brand assets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Splash and launcher icons ARE committed: they are build inputs, and CI must
# not depend on Python/Pillow being installed. Regenerate with
# tool/generate_brand_assets.py when the source art changes.

# ─── Discovery screenshots ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Kept locally, not committed: they were captured against a real account and
# show the account holder's email, phone, locker ID and name in the pixels,
# which no text-level scrub can reach. discovery-notes.md carries the findings.
discovery/shots/
